WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Another thing, what else should I add?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,840
You will know then

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,360
Dig out enough mud first

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,730
Enough digging, let's go back

5
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,090
Refreeze Shimei

6
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:10,690
You'll know when it's ready

7
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:12,610
This mud, this poisonous stone

8
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:13,650
mixed together

9
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,410
What kind of precious stone is it?

10
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:23,810
Crush the stone plum first. The more broken it is, the better. Don’t leave big pieces of fairy mushrooms.

11
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,210
This poisonous stone was broken into pieces

12
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,610
It is also a poisonous stone.

13
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:27,690
broken into slag

14
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,010
The poison is still in it

15
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:35,080
You still have a fever, so why don’t you worry? Do you think?

16
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,040
Take these poisonous stones

17
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,040
Throw it into the water and wash it

18
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,360
It's not poisonous and can be burned

19
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:41,120
How can the stones be washed clean?

20
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:45,280
It's for another thing, have you seen it?

21
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,260
Carbon is light

22
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,940
Good carbon residue that can really be burned has a small specific gravity

23
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,220
will float on the water
